window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Saint is a bear shifter on the war path. He just wants to sleep the winter away, but his rowdy neighbors in the remote Rocky Mountains valley have other plans. When the cougar shifter brothers refuse to keep the noise down, he reacts on instinct, kidnapping a beautiful female who smells like sweet berries and tempts him like no other - a female who happens to be mated to one of the brothers.</p> <p>Holly's first taste of freedom isn't going as planned. Escaping her family to join in the winter wedding celebrations at Cougar Creek with her friend Ember sounded fantastic, until a grouchy bear shifter grabs her-a gorgeous male who rouses instincts in her that are startling and powerful, igniting a fierce need to growl and stake a claim on him. A gorgeous bear who might be her fated mate.</p> <p>Can Holly resist the hungers Saint awakens in her? And when Saint realizes his mistake about her identity, can he convince the stunning Holly to give him a second chance?</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
